1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,938
Hi, I'm Ryan Rover.

2
00:00:02,118 --> 00:00:04,064
The first ten thousand dollars is the

3
00:00:04,064 --> 00:00:05,694
hardest money you'll ever save.

4
00:00:05,874 --> 00:00:07,906
Harder than the second ten thousand.

5
00:00:08,086 --> 00:00:09,456
Much harder than the tenth.

6
00:00:09,636 --> 00:00:10,936
Because at the beginning,

7
00:00:10,936 --> 00:00:13,223
