44
00:01:12,806 --> 00:01:14,028
Before we start,

45
00:01:14,028 --> 00:01:14,792
a promise.

46
00:01:14,972 --> 00:01:17,378
Nothing in this video requires you to

47
00:01:17,378 --> 00:01:18,874
live on rice and beans,

48
00:01:18,874 --> 00:01:20,435
cancel every bit of fun,

49
00:01:20,435 --> 00:01:22,321
or become a different person.

50
00:01:22,501 --> 00:01:23,929
These are practical,

51
00:01:23,929 --> 00:01:26,355
normal moves that real people use.

52
00:01:26,535 --> 00:01:28,853
Let's start with where the numbers come

53
00:01:28,853 --> 00:01:30,755
from, then the math of the first

54
00:01:30,755 --> 00:01:31,528
ten thousand.

55
