865
00:26:04,107 --> 00:26:04,867
two thousand.

866
00:26:05,047 --> 00:26:06,631
By the end of month three,

867
00:26:06,631 --> 00:26:08,398
you could be past three and a

868
00:26:08,398 --> 00:26:09,738
