873
00:26:17,901 --> 00:26:19,562
That's eight hundred a month going in.

874
00:26:19,742 --> 00:26:21,244
By the end of month six,

875
00:26:21,244 --> 00:26:23,248
you could be above six thousand.

876
00:26:23,428 --> 00:26:24,934
This is the long middle,

877
00:26:24,934 --> 00:26:26,690
so celebrate every thousand.

878
00:26:27,040 --> 00:26:28,793
Months seven to twelve.

879
00:26:28,973 --> 00:26:29,920
The sprint ends,

880
00:26:29,920 --> 00:26:32,052
so you're back to about five hundred

881
00:26:32,052 --> 00:26:32,526
a month.

882
00:26:32,706 --> 00:26:34,398
But your annual raise arrives,

883
00:26:34,398 --> 00:26:36,146
and half of it goes to savings,

884
00:26:36,146 --> 00:26:38,290
adding maybe one hundred dollars more.

885
00:26:38,470 --> 00:26:40,738
Add interest from a high yield account,

886
00:26:40,738 --> 00:26:41,902
and by month twelve,

887
00:26:41,902 --> 00:26:44,170
you're at or near ten thousand dollars.

888
00:26:44,350 --> 00:26:45,244
No lottery.

889
00:26:45,424 --> 00:26:47,108
No extreme frugality.

890
00:26:47,288 --> 00:26:49,259
Just a handful of good decisions,

891
00:26:49,259 --> 00:26:50,991
stacked on top of each other.

892
00:26:51,342 --> 00:26:53,550
And what happens next is the best

893
00:26:53,550 --> 00:26:53,884
part.

894
00:26:54,064 --> 00:26:55,992
Don't stop the automatic transfer.

895
00:26:56,172 --> 00:26:57,218
Keep it running,

896
00:26:57,218 --> 00:26:59,114
and send it to the next goal:

897
