investing for the long term,

898
00:27:00,945 --> 00:27:03,103
or paying off any remaining debt.

899
00:27:03,283 --> 00:27:05,008
You already know how to live without

900
00:27:05,008 --> 00:27:05,535
that money.

901
00:27:05,715 --> 00:27:07,531
That's the real gift of the first

902
00:27:07,531 --> 00:27:08,246
ten thousand.

903
00:27:08,426 --> 00:27:10,998
It builds the habit that builds everything

904
00:27:10,998 --> 00:27:11,549
