905
00:27:11,899 --> 00:27:13,631
Let me answer the questions I get

906
00:27:13,631 --> 00:27:15,835
most about the first ten thousand dollars.

907
00:27:16,185 --> 00:27:17,021
Question one.

908
00:27:17,201 --> 00:27:19,759
Should I save ten thousand before paying

909
00:27:19,759 --> 00:27:20,846
