910
00:27:21,026 --> 00:27:23,485
Many people build a small cushion first,

911
00:27:23,485 --> 00:27:26,190
around one thousand to two thousand dollars,

912
00:27:26,190 --> 00:27:28,096
then attack high interest debt,

913
00:27:28,096 --> 00:27:30,063
then come back to finish the ten

914
00:27:30,063 --> 00:27:30,616
thousand.

915
00:27:30,796 --> 00:27:32,668
That keeps you from adding new debt

916
00:27:32,668 --> 00:27:34,058
