917
00:27:34,238 --> 00:27:35,156
Question two.

918
00:27:35,336 --> 00:27:36,903
Should I invest it instead?

919
00:27:37,083 --> 00:27:38,558
For an emergency fund,

920
00:27:38,558 --> 00:27:40,635
most people keep it in savings,

921
00:27:40,635 --> 00:27:43,920
not stocks, because emergencies often arrive when

922
00:27:43,920 --> 00:27:45,059
