923
00:27:45,409 --> 00:27:46,442
Question three.

924
00:27:46,622 --> 00:27:48,163
What if I can only save fifty

925
00:27:48,163 --> 00:27:49,014
dollars a month?

926
00:27:49,194 --> 00:27:50,239
Start anyway.

927
00:27:50,419 --> 00:27:52,756
Fifty dollars a month is six hundred

928
00:27:52,756 --> 00:27:55,353
