932
00:28:00,821 --> 00:28:01,715
Question four.

933
00:28:01,895 --> 00:28:03,753
Is ten thousand enough?

934
00:28:03,933 --> 00:28:04,977
For many people,

935
00:28:04,977 --> 00:28:07,195
