938
00:28:12,009 --> 00:28:13,030
Question five.

939
00:28:13,210 --> 00:28:15,498
Should my partner and I save together?

940
00:28:15,678 --> 00:28:17,135
If you share expenses,

941
00:28:17,135 --> 00:28:19,453
