993
00:29:50,016 --> 00:29:51,219
And protecting it:

994
00:29:51,219 --> 00:29:52,354
stop paying fees,

995
00:29:52,354 --> 00:29:54,359
earn interest on your savings,

996
00:29:54,359 --> 00:29:56,430
